</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>A <strong>building</strong> is a structure used or intended for sheltering any use or occupancy.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-910275b9e205557188bb0c554e8e62e385c299b039bbd87cf8ab7a5567e04882">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
