    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span><strong>Value</strong> or <strong>valuation</strong> of a structure or building is the estimated cost to replace the structure or building in kind, based on either the building valuation data reported in the latest issue of the ICBO Building Standards Journal or by any alternate method approved by the City Administrator to give an accurate assessment of building replacement costs.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
