    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span><strong>Warehousing</strong> means securing a structure against vandalism, deterioration, and unauthorized entry pending its return to active use or occupancy.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
