          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/24/25/010" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">24.25.010 General.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>No building may be moved from one location to another until permits have been obtained.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-4dae32d791e469122e1742b390a9224918f279e795d7295b7a95900179fc53e2">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>
<div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_sections js-view-dom-id-e7f035380ad85d84da24ddae2a7f8fc626cc30f8c42cfc00a05e76cfc54c04ac">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
</div>

</div>

    </div>
          <div class="views-row">
           
<div class="node--embedded">
    <h3>
        <a href="/code/24/25/020" rel="bookmark"><span class="field field--name-title field--type-string field--label-hidden">24.25.020  Permit Information Required.</span>
</a>
    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>The applicant must file with Portland Permitting &amp; Development an application for a permit to move the structure, it must be signed by the owner or the owner’s authorized agent, and must contain a description of the building to be moved, the location where it is to be moved, and the use and occupancy proposed, in addition to the information required by Section 24.10.070 of this Title regarding foundation or other work at the final location.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
<div class="mb-6 view view-eva view-city-code-list view-id-city_code_list view-display-id-eva_embedded_code_chapters js-view-dom-id-ec843925f982e05d91dc10598b16bbabffa2393e4cc4d4d2bfa3b6d68e37d883">
  
    

  
  

  
  
  

  
  

  
  </div>
