    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>The City Administrator may inspect any residential building that is proposed to be moved to ensure its compliance with the provisions of Title 29 of this Code.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
