    </h3>
    



<div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--label-hidden field--name-field-section-body field--type-text-long ck-content"><div class="field__item"><p><span>The fee for a home occupation permit is as provided in Chapter 24.10 of this Title.</span></p></div></div><div class="views-element-container">
